To make a fake users with complete 3 tables with foreign keys run this command
php artisan migrate --seed
php artisan db:seed --class=RouteSeeder

\App\Models\User::factory()->count(20)->has(\App\Models\DriverProfile::factory(), 'profile')->has(\App\Models\DriverStatus::factory(), 'status')->create();

